Commercial License Exemption for Sponsor Companies

Companies that provide ongoing support through GitHub Sponsors are exempt
from commercial license fees for Nx.

Sponsor Tiers (for companies):

- Gold Sponsor — ¥50,000 per month  
  Full commercial license exemption  
  Logo displayed at the top of the README  
  Priority technical consultation (email)  
  Listed as an Nx Official Partner

- Silver Sponsor — ¥20,000 per month  
  Commercial license exemption  
  Logo displayed in the README

- Bronze Sponsor — ¥5,000 per month  
  Commercial license exemption  
  Small logo displayed in the README

If sponsorship is discontinued, standard commercial license requirements
apply beginning the following month.

