Additional Notice (Non-binding Request)

Nx includes several structural and architectural concepts, such as:

- Synchronized client-side in-memory database structures
- Isomorphic interfaces for mixed synchronous/asynchronous CRUD operations
- Abstracted UI state management
- Data models designed around worldline consistency

If you reference, adapt, or implement these architectural ideas or design
patterns, acknowledging this repository as a source of inspiration would be
greatly appreciated. Sharing your use case is also welcome and encouraging
for the author.

This notice is non-binding and does not alter the permissions granted by
this license.

